# Manifold level 10
# The wall walk (stage 5n, decision 0031): the wall's first section, at half past four. From the stair's
# foot into a courtyard of crates, three sentries at its far end; west, a corridor to a tower room, the red
# key in it and two more; a shotgun in a niche on the way. The guardhouse's red door, north: past it, the
# hall to the next section, and those who wait in it. East, a storeroom. In the start's west wall, a
# button hides a door (a shade lighter than the wall): armor. Drawn as a plan (plans/level-1.plan).
title The wall walk
spawn 0 1 1
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.22
sky 4.5

plan -20 -36
